SUMMARY:🗳️ VOTE — 2026 Kentucky Primary Election
DESCRIPTION:Polls open 6:00 AM – 6:00 PM. Hardin County uses vote centers — any registered voter can use any of 15 Election-Day locations. Bring a photo ID. Find your personalized ballot + vote-center map: https://philtaul.github.io/hardin-local-this-week/elections/find-your-ballot.html
LOCATION:Hardin County, Kentucky
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
