DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow is Election Day — polls 6 AM to 6 PM, bring photo ID
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT3H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Polls close at 6 PM today — go vote if you haven't
END:VALARM
