BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hardin-2026-primary-early-voting@hardinlocal.com
DTSTAMP:20260509T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260514
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260517
SUMMARY:Early Voting Open — 2026 KY Primary
DESCRIPTION:No-excuse in-person early voting Thursday May 14 – Saturday May 16, 8:00 AM – 4:30 PM. Two locations only — Hardin County Clerk's Office (150 N Provident Way, Elizabethtown) and Colvin Community Center (230 Freedoms Way, Radcliff). Details: https://philtaul.github.io/hardin-local-this-week/elections/find-your-ballot.html
LOCATION:Hardin County Clerk's Office, 150 N Provident Way, Elizabethtown, KY 42701
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P1D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Early voting starts tomorrow — Clerk's Office or Colvin Community Center, 8 AM to 4:30 PM
END:VALARM
